  "description": "VICNED crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H132 Dy6 N6 O42,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1D (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2D (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3D (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.769-3.806 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 110.05-112.47°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula {Dy6(H3L)6(benzoate)6}·2H2O.",
